{"voice":"kokoro af_heart","speed":0.92,"pages":{"0":{"text":"Stacey and the Sound of Sunshine","src":"p0.mp3","dur":2.75,"t":[[0.1,0.64],[0.64,1.08],[1.08,1.16],[1.16,1.38],[1.38,1.54],[1.54,1.86]]},"1":{"text":"Stacey sat by the sunny window with her guitar. Her notebook was open to a page titled “Sunny Day Song”, but the middle part kept tangling.","src":"p1.mp3","dur":9.8,"t":[[0.24,0.58],[0.58,0.9],[0.9,1.18],[1.18,1.32],[1.32,1.5],[1.5,2],[2,2.22],[2.22,2.34],[2.34,2.66],[3.54,3.62],[3.62,3.82],[3.82,4.16],[4.16,4.52],[4.52,4.72],[4.72,4.82],[4.82,5.08],[5.08,5.52],[5.52,6.32],[6.32,6.48],[6.48,6.84],[7.18,7.56],[7.56,7.66],[7.66,7.86],[7.86,8.16],[8.16,8.52],[8.52,9.1]]},"2":{"text":"“It already sounds nice,” Corey said. “I just want it to sound the way I hear it in my head,” Stacey said.","src":"p2.mp3","dur":7.13,"t":[[0.18,0.42],[0.42,0.62],[0.62,1.06],[1.06,1.66],[1.94,2.1],[2.1,2.5],[3.12,3.26],[3.26,3.44],[3.44,3.68],[3.68,3.78],[3.78,3.88],[3.88,4.1],[4.1,4.26],[4.26,4.38],[4.38,4.58],[4.58,4.8],[4.8,4.96],[4.96,5.02],[5.02,5.12],[5.12,5.48],[5.82,6.08],[6.08,6.54]]},"3":{"text":"“Can we hear it?” Zech asked gently. She played until the tricky part, then stopped.","src":"p3.mp3","dur":5.55,"t":[[0.1,0.42],[0.42,0.54],[0.54,0.74],[0.74,1.02],[1.28,1.46],[1.46,1.86],[1.86,2.12],[2.94,2.99],[2.98,3.16],[3.16,3.42],[3.42,3.58],[3.58,3.76],[3.76,4.12],[4.12,4.42],[4.42,4.78]]},"4":{"text":"Zech watched the sunlight moving on the floor. “Maybe the rhythm can move like that,” he said. “Slow, quick, slow.”","src":"p4.mp3","dur":7.65,"t":[[0.32,0.54],[0.54,0.78],[0.78,1.02],[1.02,1.22],[1.22,1.76],[1.76,1.96],[1.96,2.06],[2.06,2.34],[3.06,3.14],[3.14,3.34],[3.34,3.54],[3.54,3.74],[3.74,3.96],[3.96,4.16],[4.16,4.44],[4.62,4.8],[4.8,5.02],[5.9,5.95],[6.16,6.4],[6.68,6.88]]},"5":{"text":"Corey clapped a quiet beat. Zech tapped the pattern on his knee. One long chord, two quick notes, one warm strum, and the melody opened up like a window.","src":"p5.mp3","dur":10.5,"t":[[0.3,0.46],[0.46,0.94],[0.94,1.02],[1.02,1.28],[1.28,1.56],[2.56,2.61],[2.58,2.86],[2.86,3.12],[3.12,3.42],[3.42,3.56],[3.56,3.68],[3.68,3.88],[4.6,4.65],[4.64,4.86],[4.86,5.3],[5.72,5.86],[5.86,6.1],[6.1,6.36],[6.72,6.88],[6.88,7.08],[7.08,7.64],[7.98,8.14],[8.14,8.24],[8.24,8.48],[8.48,8.9],[8.9,9.14],[9.14,9.32],[9.32,9.44],[9.44,9.72]]},"7":{"text":"What Stacey learned “That is it!” Stacey laughed, and played the whole song again, not because it was perfect, but because now it sounded like her.","src":"p7.mp3","dur":9.55,"t":[[0,0.44],[0.44,0.64],[0.64,1.1],[1.86,1.98],[1.98,2.14],[2.14,2.36],[3.02,3.18],[3.18,3.64],[3.64,4.06],[4.06,4.26],[4.26,4.44],[4.44,4.56],[4.56,4.84],[4.84,5.24],[5.58,5.78],[5.78,6.08],[6.08,6.24],[6.24,6.34],[6.34,6.76],[7.24,7.38],[7.38,7.6],[7.6,7.88],[7.88,8.16],[8.16,8.38],[8.38,8.72],[8.72,8.92]]},"8":{"text":"3 big takeaways Word to know chord A chord is a group of musical notes played together at the same time. Music Ideas From Sunlight When Stacey's song got tangled, Zech watched the sunlight moving on the floor and said the music could move like that: slow, quick, slow. One long chord and two quick notes helped the song open up. Make It Sound Like You Stacey's song already sounded nice, but she wanted it to sound the way she heard it in her head. With help from Zech and Corey she found it, and the song finally sounded like her. Try it at home: Watch something that moves, like a curtain in a breeze or leaves outside, and hum or tap a tune with long and short sounds that moves the same way.","src":"p8.mp3","dur":27,"t":[[0,0.25],[0.5,0.74],[0.74,1.22],[1.88,1.96],[1.96,2.14],[2.14,2.32],[2.88,3.04],[3.6,3.65],[3.62,3.82],[3.82,4],[4,4.06],[4.06,4.26],[4.26,4.4],[4.4,4.6],[4.6,5.14],[5.14,5.38],[5.38,5.72],[5.72,5.96],[5.96,6.06],[6.06,6.24],[6.24,6.7],[7.44,7.49],[7.44,7.78],[7.78,8.14],[8.14,8.42],[9.16,9.34],[9.34,9.78],[9.78,10.02],[10.02,10.24],[10.24,10.52],[11.06,11.16],[11.16,11.48],[11.48,11.72],[11.72,11.96],[11.9